{"fps": 30, "frames": 1684, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 220, "text": "In nineteen eleven, Standard Oil got smashed into thirty-four pieces. And John D. Rockefeller got richer.", "words": [{"w": "In", "f": 0, "e": 5}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 7, "e": 16}, {"w": "eleven,", "f": 18, "e": 37}, {"w": "Standard", "f": 39, "e": 50}, {"w": "Oil", "f": 53, "e": 59}, {"w": "got", "f": 62, "e": 66}, {"w": "smashed", "f": 71, "e": 85}, {"w": "into", "f": 87, "e": 94}, {"w": "thirty-four", "f": 96, "e": 112}, {"w": "pieces.", "f": 114, "e": 137}, {"w": "And", "f": 144, "e": 149}, {"w": "John", "f": 151, "e": 155}, {"w": "D.", "f": 158, "e": 162}, {"w": "Rockefeller", "f": 165, "e": 183}, {"w": "got", "f": 185, "e": 190}, {"w": "richer.", "f": 194, "e": 206}]}, {"a": 220, "b": 279, "text": "Imagine you own its stock.", "words": [{"w": "Imagine", "f": 222, "e": 235}, {"w": "you", "f": 238, "e": 242}, {"w": "own", "f": 245, "e": 247}, {"w": "its", "f": 249, "e": 254}, {"w": "stock.", "f": 261, "e": 274}]}, {"a": 279, "b": 441, "text": "It once refined nine of every ten American barrels, and it loved secrets.", "words": [{"w": "It", "f": 281, "e": 286}, {"w": "once", "f": 288, "e": 293}, {"w": "refined", "f": 295, "e": 309}, {"w": "nine", "f": 313, "e": 320}, {"w": "of", "f": 322, "e": 325}, {"w": "every", "f": 329, "e": 336}, {"w": "ten", "f": 341, "e": 345}, {"w": "American", "f": 347, "e": 359}, {"w": "barrels,", "f": 361, "e": 384}, {"w": "and", "f": 386, "e": 389}, {"w": "it", "f": 391, "e": 393}, {"w": "loved", "f": 398, "e": 407}, {"w": "secrets.", "f": 409, "e": 434}]}, {"a": 441, "b": 544, "text": "Then the Supreme Court gives it six months to split up.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 443, "e": 450}, {"w": "the", "f": 457, "e": 458}, {"w": "Supreme", "f": 459, "e": 471}, {"w": "Court", "f": 473, "e": 480}, {"w": "gives", "f": 482, "e": 485}, {"w": "it", "f": 487, "e": 491}, {"w": "six", "f": 494, "e": 501}, {"w": "months", "f": 505, "e": 512}, {"w": "to", "f": 514, "e": 517}, {"w": "split", "f": 519, "e": 526}, {"w": "up.", "f": 528, "e": 535}]}, {"a": 544, "b": 675, "text": "Your one stock becomes thirty-four, a slice of every piece.", "words": [{"w": "Your", "f": 546, "e": 551}, {"w": "one", "f": 553, "e": 558}, {"w": "stock", "f": 560, "e": 571}, {"w": "becomes", "f": 574, "e": 585}, {"w": "thirty-four,", "f": 587, "e": 617}, {"w": "a", "f": 618, "e": 619}, {"w": "slice", "f": 622, "e": 633}, {"w": "of", "f": 635, "e": 640}, {"w": "every", "f": 642, "e": 649}, {"w": "piece.", "f": 651, "e": 665}]}, {"a": 675, "b": 782, "text": "Rockefeller owns a quarter. Surely, this ends him.", "words": [{"w": "Rockefeller", "f": 677, "e": 695}, {"w": "owns", "f": 697, "e": 702}, {"w": "a", "f": 703, "e": 704}, {"w": "quarter.", "f": 706, "e": 718}, {"w": "Surely,", "f": 734, "e": 745}, {"w": "this", "f": 749, "e": 752}, {"w": "ends", "f": 754, "e": 761}, {"w": "him.", "f": 763, "e": 768}]}, {"a": 782, "b": 885, "text": "Two years later, the pieces are worth twice the old whole.", "words": [{"w": "Two", "f": 784, "e": 789}, {"w": "years", "f": 791, "e": 798}, {"w": "later,", "f": 800, "e": 814}, {"w": "the", "f": 816, "e": 818}, {"w": "pieces", "f": 823, "e": 827}, {"w": "are", "f": 830, "e": 832}, {"w": "worth", "f": 834, "e": 841}, {"w": "twice", "f": 843, "e": 855}, {"w": "the", "f": 856, "e": 857}, {"w": "old", "f": 859, "e": 866}, {"w": "whole.", "f": 871, "e": 878}]}, {"a": 885, "b": 958, "text": "And Rockefeller's fortune triples.", "words": [{"w": "And", "f": 887, "e": 889}, {"w": "Rockefeller's", "f": 891, "e": 910}, {"w": "fortune", "f": 912, "e": 926}, {"w": "triples.", "f": 928, "e": 946}]}, {"a": 958, "b": 1038, "text": "So how does chopping something up make it bigger?", "words": [{"w": "So", "f": 960, "e": 962}, {"w": "how", "f": 965, "e": 967}, {"w": "does", "f": 969, "e": 974}, {"w": "chopping", "f": 976, "e": 985}, {"w": "something", "f": 987, "e": 997}, {"w": "up", "f": 999, "e": 1003}, {"w": "make", "f": 1006, "e": 1008}, {"w": "it", "f": 1010, "e": 1013}, {"w": "bigger?", "f": 1015, "e": 1026}]}, {"a": 1038, "b": 1134, "text": "You see, picture a locked toolbox at a yard sale.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 1040, "e": 1042}, {"w": "see,", "f": 1045, "e": 1058}, {"w": "picture", "f": 1063, "e": 1067}, {"w": "a", "f": 1070, "e": 1072}, {"w": "locked", "f": 1074, "e": 1081}, {"w": "toolbox", "f": 1083, "e": 1099}, {"w": "at", "f": 1101, "e": 1102}, {"w": "a", "f": 1103, "e": 1104}, {"w": "yard", "f": 1106, "e": 1113}, {"w": "sale.", "f": 1115, "e": 1125}]}, {"a": 1134, "b": 1255, "text": "Open it, tag every tool, and the same stuff sells for more.", "words": [{"w": "Open", "f": 1136, "e": 1143}, {"w": "it,", "f": 1145, "e": 1157}, {"w": "tag", "f": 1161, "e": 1166}, {"w": "every", "f": 1169, "e": 1173}, {"w": "tool,", "f": 1175, "e": 1191}, {"w": "and", "f": 1192, "e": 1193}, {"w": "the", "f": 1195, "e": 1198}, {"w": "same", "f": 1200, "e": 1207}, {"w": "stuff", "f": 1209, "e": 1218}, {"w": "sells", "f": 1221, "e": 1227}, {"w": "for", "f": 1230, "e": 1232}, {"w": "more.", "f": 1234, "e": 1250}]}, {"a": 1255, "b": 1333, "text": "Standard Oil was that locked box.", "words": [{"w": "Standard", "f": 1257, "e": 1269}, {"w": "Oil", "f": 1273, "e": 1282}, {"w": "was", "f": 1285, "e": 1289}, {"w": "that", "f": 1291, "e": 1298}, {"w": "locked", "f": 1301, "e": 1307}, {"w": "box.", "f": 1310, "e": 1323}]}, {"a": 1333, "b": 1454, "text": "The breakup made investors look inside and price every piece.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1335, "e": 1337}, {"w": "breakup", "f": 1339, "e": 1351}, {"w": "made", "f": 1353, "e": 1358}, {"w": "investors", "f": 1363, "e": 1374}, {"w": "look", "f": 1376, "e": 1381}, {"w": "inside", "f": 1390, "e": 1399}, {"w": "and", "f": 1401, "e": 1406}, {"w": "price", "f": 1408, "e": 1417}, {"w": "every", "f": 1422, "e": 1429}, {"w": "piece.", "f": 1431, "e": 1449}]}, {"a": 1454, "b": 1557, "text": "Same refineries. Same pipelines. Same oil.", "words": [{"w": "Same", "f": 1456, "e": 1463}, {"w": "refineries.", "f": 1466, "e": 1487}, {"w": "Same", "f": 1490, "e": 1497}, {"w": "pipelines.", "f": 1499, "e": 1522}, {"w": "Same", "f": 1527, "e": 1534}, {"w": "oil.", "f": 1536, "e": 1547}]}, {"a": 1557, "b": 1684, "text": "The court didn't shrink Rockefeller. It opened his box.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 1559, "e": 1561}, {"w": "court", "f": 1563, "e": 1570}, {"w": "didn't", "f": 1573, "e": 1579}, {"w": "shrink", "f": 1582, "e": 1589}, {"w": "Rockefeller.", "f": 1591, "e": 1611}, {"w": "It", "f": 1621, "e": 1625}, {"w": "opened", "f": 1627, "e": 1637}, {"w": "his", "f": 1639, "e": 1643}, {"w": "box.", "f": 1646, "e": 1666}]}]}